 "notes": [
  "Total 60 as published (no header counts).",
  "'Opening Setup' lists Hidden Base (Obj), Rendezvous Point (Sys), The Signal (Starting Int), Rebel Fleet (Eff) and Alderaan (HB/Sys); these count toward the 60. With the second Alderaan under Systems the deck runs two Alderaan.",
  "Posted 'Rallitir' dested the Light Ralltiir system; 'Jabba's Palace Audience Chamber' the Light site; 'Hyperescape' Hyper Escape; 'Star Destroyer' the Special Edition interrupt Star Destroyer!; 'Traffice Control' Traffic Control.",
  "Control is the Dagobah Lost Interrupt (the Coruscant Control came later); Wise Advice is the Special Edition Effect (no Defensive Shields existed in February 2000).",
  "Posted 'Artoo' dested the Jabba's Palace Artoo (the strategy pairs him with A Gift); 'Devaronian' the non-unique Jabba's Palace alien."
 ],
